Package: cafast
Type: Package
Title: Fast Engineering Companions to the CAs Package for Covering Arrays
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Christopher Smolen
Maintainer: Christopher Smolen <chrispbsmolen@gmail.com>
Description: Fast replacements and generalisations of selected routines of
    the CAs package by Ulrike Groemping: a C implementation of maxconstant
    (largest set of rows that can be made constant), a power construction
    of Colbourn and Torres-Jimenez for any strength, number of columns and
    number of levels (not only the catalogued settings), the counting
    kernel of ca-tools, and postopNCK_c, a fast Nayeri-Colbourn-Konjevod
    post-optimizer calibrated against CAs::postopNCK. Every function is
    tested against its CAs counterpart; the batteries are in inst/tests.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: CAs
Suggests: caverify, lhs
NeedsCompilation: yes
